    "basis": "8h shift minus 30 min break = 7.5h paid, about 6h (360 min) productive. Timings: departure 35-45 min for a standard room (we use 45-55 min because retreat rooms average ~3 guests each at full occupancy), stayover 20-25 min, plus 2-5h of public-area cleaning a day (meditation hall, corridors, toilets), with a +10% buffer. Occupied rooms assumed to be about guests/2, capped at 41 (1-15 guests: up to 8 rooms; 16-35: 18; 36-60: 30; 61+: all 41). Benchmark: 15-17 room credits per attendant per shift (departure = 1, stayover = 0.5); 3-star 16-18 rooms/shift, 4-star 13-15. Supervisor: 1 per 8-12 attendants, or 1 inspector per 4-6 attendants. Below ~3 attendants a working lead attendant inspects instead.",
    "notes": "At 0 guests, deep-clean and project work is optional (judgement call). Many retreat centres only do a light stayover service or none mid-retreat; if so, the stayover line drops to about 1-2 people for public areas only.",
